# SESAME-style 1T-only (NON-3T) EOS fixture for the [13c]/#11 rejection test.
# This material carries only a single TOTAL EOS table (301: combined ion+electron
# pressure/energy, no separate electron/ion data), so the 2T/3T reader MUST reject
# it with a clear error -- per ADR-0007 there is no 1T->2T split modelling. The
# reader rejects because no electron table (304) and no ion table (303/305) are
# present; the (illustrative) total-EOS values are still well formed.
#
# header: matid ntables
   3720   1
# --- SESAME table 301 (total EOS (1T)) ---
# table id, nr, nt
   301   4   5
# density nodes [g/cc] (log-spaced ascending)
 1.0000000000000000e-03 1.0000000000000000e-02 1.0000000000000001e-01 1.0000000000000000e+00
# temperature nodes [eV] (log-spaced ascending)
 1.0000000000000000e+00 1.0000000000000000e+01 1.0000000000000000e+02 1.0000000000000000e+03
 1.0000000000000000e+04
# p_total  [it][ir] (density index fastest)
 1.2999999999999999e-03 1.3000000000000001e-02 1.3000000000000000e-01 1.3000000000000000e+00
 1.3000000000000001e-02 1.3000000000000000e-01 1.3000000000000003e+00 1.3000000000000000e+01
 1.3000000000000000e-01 1.3000000000000000e+00 1.3000000000000002e+01 1.3000000000000000e+02
 1.3000000000000000e+00 1.3000000000000000e+01 1.3000000000000000e+02 1.3000000000000000e+03
 1.3000000000000000e+01 1.3000000000000000e+02 1.3000000000000000e+03 1.3000000000000000e+04
